# What to bring

Planning to register for 2027-28 kindergarten? Please bring:

- A birth certificate
- Proof of address
- Immunization records

Registration opens on 2027-01-12.

# Getting here

- Park free in the Elm Street lot. It has 60 spaces.
- Take the free shuttle from the Pine Street church lot. It runs every 10 minutes.
- Childcare for siblings is offered in the music room.

# Questions

Call 555-0166 or write to office@cedarwood.example. We are happy to help.
